      "id": "bayes",
      "prompt": "一种病患病率2%，试剂敏感度80%，未患病者误报率10%。随机一人阳性，他患病概率多少？请把假阳性计入并推导。",
      "runId": "f15fd2ab-be1d-4d42-b36d-16f5f71fdc38",
      "run": {
        "status": "succeeded",
        "errorCode": null,
        "route": {
          "version": 1,
          "workload": "adaptive",
          "entryMode": "direct_fast",
          "resourceDecision": {
            "path": "answer",
            "source": "model",
